    "intro": "The **Massage Business Name Generator** suggests names for a massage therapy practice, sports massage clinic or mobile massage therapist: catchy, classic and professional, modern, sports and remedial, holistic, your town or your own name.",
    "sections": [],
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "How do I check a massage business name is free?",
        "answer": "Press Check on any name to see whether it's free as a company, a domain and a social media handle. In the UK, also search Companies House; in the US, search your state's business register and the USPTO trade mark search. Check your local area too, as another business nearby with a similar name can confuse clients."
      },
      {
        "question": "What's a good name for a massage business?",
        "answer": "A good massage business name sounds calm and professional, says what you offer (sports, remedial, deep tissue, pregnancy or holistic massage) and can't be misread. Clinical words such as \"therapy\", \"clinic\" and \"remedial\" build trust; avoid jokes, \"luxury\" words and anything that could suggest a different kind of business. In many US states only a licensed massage therapist may advertise massage, so check your state board's rules before you choose a name."
      }
    ]
